{"slug":"visual-studio-ctrl-z-delete-whole-cell(Solve)","title":"visual studio ctrl+z delete whole cell(Solve)","date":"2023-09-19","updated":"","tags":["visual studio","Python","gossip"],"categories":[],"cover":"/img/cover/code.jpg","excerpt":"會把Cell刪除，真的是惡夢 可以先試試 or 左邊 Timeline 也可以找到過去的時間線","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h2 id=\"目前找到兩個方法\"><a href=\"#目前找到兩個方法\">目前找到兩個方法</a></h2>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Ctrl + Z</span></span></code></span> 會把Cell刪除，真的是惡夢</p>\n<p>可以先試試<span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Ctrl + Y</span></span></code></span> or <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>ESC + Z</span></span></code></span></p>\n<p>左邊 Timeline 也可以找到過去的時間線</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://file.notion.so/f/f/aa7d30ee-c6ed-4ce4-91c8-c79bede1cbaf/9ae092de-942f-4088-86fc-ac3a7f03c092/Untitled.png?id=516418d1-581d-41a0-9137-b9b1bc9ea977&#x26;table=block&#x26;spaceId=aa7d30ee-c6ed-4ce4-91c8-c79bede1cbaf&#x26;expirationTimestamp=1695182400000&#x26;signature=zYLrzk0XP9isfsTMP-mlpl-YZgNsHERxx7DcOIQd6xA&#x26;downloadName=Untitled.png\" alt=\"Untitled\"></p>"}